[[Warrior Istani armor]] is an art type available in the Nightfall campaign, as starter armor, [[collector armor]] for the region of [[Istan]], and as regular crafted armor. The collector helm is only available with a [[Strength]] +1 bonus.

There is no [[prestige armor|prestige]] version of Istani armor.

